        "raw": "<p>Just been thinking about how characters from Sentinels of the Multiverse don&#39;t always tend to be &#39;alive&#39; in the way we understand it. I was thinking of gathering a list, as my own reference/amusement.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Ones I can think of, off the top of my head:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Dark Watch era Mr Fixer, a ghost haunting his own corpse</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Fanatic... I can&#39;t put that into a simple sentence.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Absolute Zero, who doesn&#39;t eat, breathe or sleep</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Any others we know of?&nbsp;</p>",
