        "id": 206075,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-09T16:50:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>\"Aliveness\" in the Sentinels verse seems to revolve around the twin ideas of sapience (re: stuff like how discussion of what beings could become a Virtuoso seems to revolve around sapience and what counts as being sapient) and some sort of nebulous idea of the \"soul\" (re: stuff like the weird Void afterlife thing, Fixer's situation, how Idealist wasn't seen as being truly alive until she got that life energy spark, etc.)</p><p><span>Though granted this still raises about as many questions as it answers.</span></p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:35:29.974Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
