      {
        "id": 206078,
        "name": "Chaosmancer",
        "username": "Chaosmancer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-10-10T02:27:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, quite a few \"do their bodies count as alive\" characters</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Dark Watch Fixer</p>\n<p>Fanatic</p>\n<p>Apostate</p>\n<p>Absolute Zero</p>\n<p>Writhe</p>\n<p>Medico</p>\n<p>Omnitron</p>\n<p>Gloomweaver in both forms</p>\n<p>Spite… yeah drugged monstrosity and undead spite</p>\n<p>Akash of many&nbsp; names</p>\n<p>Anubis</p>\n<p>The Vampires</p>\n<p>Biomancer and his children</p>\n<p>Zhu Long</p>\n<p>Wager Master</p>\n<p>Oblivaeon and the scions and aeon men (Borr, Nixious, Darkmind, Voidsoul, Aeon Master, Sanction, Empyreon, Progeny, Faultless)</p>\n<p>Balarian</p>\n<p>Spoiler <font color=\"white\">AeonGirl </font></p>\n<p>Mangrove</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And then with the \"defintely alive but confusing\" section I'd put</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Nightmist</p>\n<p>Scholar</p>\n<p>Guise</p>\n<p>Haka</p>\n<p>Idealist</p>\n<p>Idolater</p>\n<p>Kaagra and the Bloodsworn</p>\n<p>Jansa and&nbsp; Endlings</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And I probably forgot a few obvious places on the list</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:35:30.184Z",
