        "raw": "Yeah, quite a few &quot;do their bodies count as alive&quot; characters\n\n&nbsp;\n\nDark Watch Fixer\n\nFanatic\n\nApostate\n\nAbsolute Zero\n\nWrithe\n\nMedico\n\nOmnitron\n\nGloomweaver in both forms\n\nSpite... yeah drugged monstrosity and undead spite\n\nAkash of many&nbsp; names\n\nAnubis\n\nThe Vampires\n\nBiomancer and his children\n\nZhu Long\n\nWager Master\n\nOblivaeon and the scions and aeon men (Borr, Nixious, Darkmind, Voidsoul, Aeon Master, Sanction, Empyreon, Progeny, Faultless)\n\nBalarian\n\nSpoiler [color=white]AeonGirl [/color]\n\nMangrove\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\nAnd then with the &quot;defintely alive but confusing&quot; section I&#39;d put\n\n&nbsp;\n\nNightmist\n\nScholar\n\nGuise\n\nHaka\n\nIdealist\n\nIdolater\n\nKaagra and the Bloodsworn\n\nJansa and&nbsp; Endlings\n\n&nbsp;\n\nAnd I probably forgot a few obvious places on the list\n",
